@anon.8ad231a129453d088979dfad2582f60a.1284 = private unnamed_addr constant [466 x i8] c"## What it does\0AChecks that a TODO comment is labelled with \22TODO\22.\0A\0A## Why is this bad?\0AAmbiguous tags reduce code visibility and can lead to dangling TODOs.\0AFor example, if a comment is tagged with \22FIXME\22 rather than \22TODO\22, it may\0Abe overlooked by future readers.\0A\0ANote that this rule will only flag \22FIXME\22 and \22XXX\22 tags as incorrect.\0A\0A## Example\0A```python\0A# FIXME(ruff): this should get fixed!\0A```\0A\0AUse instead:\0A```python\0A# TODO(ruff): this is now fixed!\0A```\0A", align 1
